# m6_cores: CORE HOURS pays once. m6_pickup's input to 1500 (the sweep and its long hold at
# 806..885 that leaves the bar at 20) plus a hold-B at 1390..1399 just after the core hours
# crate is collected. Fuel is meta state (not in the World), so the grant is paid by main.zig
# against a high-water mark on the World counter debug_cores.
# - 1383 (game tick 1112): crate collected, cores 0 -> 1, fuel 70 -> 130 (+60), score 330.
# - B 1390..1399 (10 frames = 20 ticks, 2 fuel each): 1392 is back at tick 1112, still
#   collected; 1393 (tick 1110) is before the grab: cores 0, score 230, the crate back on
#   screen. The fuel is NOT given back by the rewind: 122 (130 minus the hold's 8). 1399:
#   tick 1098, fuel 110. 1400: the release (PLAYING, no tick).
# - 1411 (tick 1109): the ship grabs the same crate again: cores 1, score 330 (the +100 is
#   World state and comes back), but the fuel stays 111 (the refill alone; 1412: 112):
#   cores never rises above its high-water mark of 1, so nothing more is paid.
--frames 1500 --dump-exports debug_state,debug_cores,debug_fuel,debug_score --at "1382 debug_fuel == 70" --at "1383 debug_cores == 1" --at "1383 debug_fuel == 130" --at "1392 debug_cores == 1" --at "1393 debug_state == 5" --at "1393 debug_cores == 0" --at "1393 debug_score == 230" --at "1393 debug_fuel == 122" --at "1393 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1399 debug_game_tick == 1098" --at "1399 debug_fuel == 110" --at "1400 debug_state == 1" --at "1410 debug_cores == 0" --at "1411 debug_cores == 1" --at "1411 debug_score == 330" --at "1411 debug_fuel == 111" --at "1412 debug_fuel == 112" --at "1450 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_cores == 1"
